    <p><strong>Important:</strong> Laws and land-manager rules change. This article is educational, not legal or medical advice. Before carrying or using cannabis near the A.T., check the current Maine statute and the rules for the exact land manager, park, campground, or private property. Never hike, navigate, ford, climb, or drive while impaired.</p>
